+| Row strips | 22 | 22 |
+| Pixels | 120,560,400 | 120,560,400 |
+| Valid pixels | 120,540,008 (99.9831 %) | 120,560,299 (99.9999 %) |
+| Invalid pixels | 20,392 | 101 |
