++1. **Normalisation method.** Resolved far enough to decide, not decided yet.
++   Stable-land error favours a global linear fit on both local pairs (A 39.6 %
++   against 36.5 % for histogram, B 32.0 % against 31.5 %). Positive controls on
++   the 13 OSCD development regions point the other way: histogram preserved the
++   labelled change amplitude better in 13 of 13 regions (median 0.988 against
