++   method destroyed change: no region fell below 0.837 preservation, and AUROC
++   improved in 12 of 13 regions under both. Recommendation: keep histogram,
++   because losing 16 % of the change amplitude in the worst region is a worse
++   failure for this task than a 3.6 percentage-point difference in stable-land
